:null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Tested in Godot 4.5.1 and Godot 4.5 (Official Releases).\n\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 (Custom ISO) (Also happens in Windows 10 Normal) (Vulkan Forward+) RTX 3060, Ryzen 7 5700G. Godot 4.5.1 and Godot 4.5\n\n### Issue description\n\nIm trying to auto detect my engine compilations for using the custom build for ensuring that not anyone decompiles my game and It crashes, for my friend that also happens.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca7a27ee-0e03-4a9b-8c03-54f002185cba\n\n<img width=\"470\" height=\"73\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bbfb5548-82d8-42b0-a095-6cfc84fe7b48\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Enter my game project -> go to project -> tools -> Engine Compilation Configuration Editor -> Detect from Project -> It crashes\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIt isn't caused by a project, its caused by the .godot cache and godot editor cache. When I deleted the %Appdata% and %LocalAppdata% Godot Folders, and the .godot folder in my project it worked.","closed_by":{"login":"hxgohxrr","id":112127708,"node_id":"U_kgDOBq7u3A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112127708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hxgohxrr","html_url":"https://github.com/hxgohxrr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hxgohxrr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hxgohxrr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hxgohxrr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hxgohxrr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hxgohxrr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hxg